{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Trials - Chapter One, is a choose your own adventure, horror visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chapter One is a complete  story, that will become part of a bigger world. Each Chapter will be a stand alone adventure that can be played in any order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/538e63d0f9b18907443f406740941b2c.poster.avif?t=1753384908\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/538e63d0f9b18907443f406740941b2c.webp?t=1753384908\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own choices to try and escape your trial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/48e75e17c57483d303d48030cace2bba.poster.avif?t=1753384908\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/48e75e17c57483d303d48030cace2bba.webp?t=1753384908\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock all 30 endings, and find the secret Hidden Ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/489f1813c6a3072d8cdb3a2daae3af54.poster.avif?t=1753384908\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/489f1813c6a3072d8cdb3a2daae3af54.webp?t=1753384908\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many deaths await you, but don't be discouraged, you can try again. There must be some safe paths... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/d44225a1253291e24e481018f9504457.avif?t=1753384908\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good luck!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/227b9df4eaa1f266e75b46c2401cd21d.avif?t=1753384908\" data-has-big /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568470?t=1753384908","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/9b49bf544b862168b4f3eba129388a3068124d94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753384908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/d664918d1fb5b193bc659e6b87e93f67a358e208/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753384908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/d664918d1fb5b193bc659e6b87e93f67a358e208/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753384908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Unrealistic blood splatter and few non detailed wounds."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Trials - Chapter One, is a choose your own adventure, horror visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chapter One is a complete  story, that will become part of a bigger world. Each Chapter will be a stand alone adventure that can be played in any order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/538e63d0f9b18907443f406740941b2c.poster.avif?t=1753384908\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a